{"meta":{"id":"tt41054228","type":"series","name":"Devils' Crest","imdb_id":"tt41054228","description":"Una serie nueva de Reki Kawahara, autor de Accel World y Sword Art Online. Sword Art Online presentó la realidad virtual, Sword Art Online the Movie: Ordinal Scale exploró la realidad aumentada. Ahora, Devils' Crest se adentra en la realidad mixta. Actual Magic, el primer videojuego de inmersión total, y el mundo real se fusionan, y comienza un nuevo juego mortal, que también es realidad.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt41054228.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fA6eLsm6xEBK90IK3UNWoVPZBn7.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/27onkBjyvWdzAXjfaiUaYMYzQqN.png","genres":["Action & Adventure","Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Animación"],"releaseInfo":"2026-","released":"2026-11-06T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Returning Series","runtime":"24 min","imdbRating":"7.1","country":"Japan","cast":["白石晴香","稲垣好","広瀬裕也","天野聡美"],"writer":["川原礫","梅原英司"],"trailers":[{"source":"fB4EfJcItPE","type":"Trailer","name":"The first PV [ENG SUB]","ytId":"fB4EfJcItPE","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"fB4EfJcItPE","title":"The first PV [ENG SUB]"}],"links":[{"name":"7.1","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt41054228"},{"name":"Action & Adventure","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Action+%26+Adventure"},{"name":"Sci-Fi & Fantasy","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Sci-Fi+%26+Fantasy"},{"name":"Animación","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Animaci%C3%B3n"},{"name":"白石晴香","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=%E7%99%BD%E7%9F%B3%E6%99%B4%E9%A6%99"},{"name":"稲垣好","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=%E7%A8%B2%E5%9E%A3%E5%A5%BD"},{"name":"広瀬裕也","cat